 if(id==='zone')extra=`<div class="form-grid"><label>Zoning starts<input name="zoneStart" type="time" value="${toTime(state.settings.zoneWindow.start)}" required></label><label>Zoning ends<input name="zoneEnd" type="time" value="${toTime(state.settings.zoneWindow.end)}" required></label></div><p class="helper">The window and shift capacity determine how many aisles fit. Oldest completed zones come first. Individual aisle estimates are editable in Aisles & departments.</p>`;
 if(id==='topstock')extra=`<label class="block-label">Top-stock work days</label>${daysPicker('topDays',state.settings.topstockDays)}<p class="helper">Remaining aisles are divided over your selected work days through Friday. Assignments are balanced between available, eligible people. Capacity shortfalls stay visible; a Friday finish needs enough staffed time.</p>`;
